Third-party components
----------------------

nyx depends on, but does not include, the packages named in pyproject.toml.
Each carries its own licence.

The Morlet wavelet code in src/nyx/features.py and the time-frequency viewer in
src/nyx/gui/viewers.py are derived from ephyviewer (NeuralEnsemble), which is
distributed under the MIT licence. Those files say so where the derivation
happens.
